/* ============================================================================
 * CONJECTURE (NOT PROVED) -- R1 electrical onset Sigma_1
 * ============================================================================
 * RETIRED to conjecture status per formalization review.  The previous proved
 * "R1_routh.kyx" (3 entries) was judged TAUTOLOGICAL -- it did not capture R1:
 *   - old R1.1 assumed "D8=a8*D7 & D7=0 -> D8=0" (substitution), NOT the
 *     Lienard-Chipart equivalence "A_e Hurwitz <=> Delta_k(p)>0 for all k";
 *   - old R1.2 assumed "W>0 exists -> exists W2=W" (identity), NOT existence of a
 *     positive real root of the even part E(W)=omega0^2;
 *   - old R1.3 assumed "dRe/dLg=m*cs, m,cs>0 -> >0", injecting the numerical
 *     transversality value (+644) as a premise -- simulation as proof.
 *
 * GENUINE R1 TARGETS (open; require a CAS able to expand the 8x8 chi(s;p) and the
 * 7th Hurwitz minor Delta_7(p) as polynomials in (Lf,Cf,Rf,Lg,Rg,K_ad,Kpi,Kii)):
 *   (i)   A_e(p) Hurwitz  <=>  Delta_k(p)>0 for all k  (Lienard-Chipart);
 *   (ii)  Sigma_1 := {Delta_7(p)=0, Delta_1..6>0} carries exactly one conjugate pair
 *         on the imaginary axis;
 *   (iii) d Re(lambda)/d Lg > 0 along Sigma_1, via the spectral-perturbation identity
 *         Re[dlambda/dLg] = Re[ w^H (dA_e/dLg) v / (w^H v) ] with dA_e/dLg expanded
 *         SYMBOLICALLY (no injected numbers).
 * CAS (sympy) times out on the full symbolic determinant; the realistic deliverable
 * is a parametric SIGN CHART on the (Lg,Cf,K_ad) face via Maple/Mathematica/Sage
 * Groebner, NOT a closed form.  NUMERICAL evidence only (risk_numerical.py): deg-13
 * Delta_7(g), Re=0 crossing, omega0=12Hz != omega_LCL=553Hz, dRe/dLg=+644.
 *
 * This file is a Problem-only CONJECTURE placeholder (no Tactic): it does NOT claim a
 * proof.  Per project convention, filename is prefixed `conjecture_`.  The Problem
 * below states the abstract target shape (a pair +-i*sqrt(W) on the axis); the hard
 * content -- that A_e(p) realizes it as a function of p on Sigma_1 -- is the open task. */

ArchiveEntry "conjecture_R1: electrical onset has an imaginary pair (TARGET; no tactic)"

Problem
  \forall W \forall s
  ( W > 0 & s^2 + W = 0  ->  s^2 = -W )
End.

End.
